           {
            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/vw531zy4220#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "Graded high on the figures of the date: every figure is plain. Ink. Two names: a second name stands to the right of the date, apparently beginning 'Hohn-', not securely legible; 'Wissler' below the date is clear apart from a bar over the middle letters, so Wossler or Wussler cannot be excluded."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
